<blockquote class="uncited"><div>For reliable predictions, how often should we install new satellite keps?</div></blockquote>Depends which satellite(s) you are trying to access.<br><br>The ISS is moved frequently to prevent collision with debris.<br><br>So updating daily for the ISS is often necessary. Other satellites, AFIK you can probably get away with updating once a week.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu May 29, 2025 3:40 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
